WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.306 --> 00:00:03.328
- [Narrator] This is an okapi.

00:00:03.328 --> 00:00:05.660
They may look like zebras,
but they are actually

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.670
the only living relative of giraffes.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.350
(lively, bouncy music)

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.879
Endemic to the Democratic
Republic of Congo,

00:00:14.879 --> 00:00:17.289
the okapi is a solitary animal that lives

00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:19.761
only in dense forests.

00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:22.230
Their coloring is distinctive.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.481
Their deep red coat contrasts
with black and white markings

00:00:25.481 --> 00:00:28.361
across their hind side and legs.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:32.846
These specific markings act
as camouflage among the trees.

00:00:32.846 --> 00:00:35.735
Similar to giraffes,
okapis have long tongues

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:38.929
that they use to pull
leaves from branches.

00:00:38.929 --> 00:00:42.129
Their tongues are between
14 and 18 inches in length,

00:00:42.129 --> 00:00:46.655
so long that they can clean
their ears and eyes with it.

00:00:46.655 --> 00:00:49.804
The okapi are known for
having incredible hearing.

00:00:49.804 --> 00:00:52.121
Their large ears can detect
the slightest disturbance

00:00:52.121 --> 00:00:55.408
around them, which helps
protect them from predators.

00:00:55.408 --> 00:00:57.326
It is believed that in the last decade,

00:00:57.326 --> 00:00:59.433
okapi populations have been halved

00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:02.243
due to deforestation and hunting.

00:01:02.243 --> 00:01:04.671
The presence of armed groups
in their native habitat

00:01:04.671 --> 00:01:07.097
makes conservation
efforts nearly impossible,

00:01:07.097 --> 00:01:09.529
but local governments are stepping up.

00:01:09.529 --> 00:01:12.904
The okapi is a fully protected
species under Congolese law

00:01:12.904 --> 00:01:15.729
and is a national symbol for the country.

00:01:15.729 --> 00:01:17.146
This is an okapi.

00:01:24.034 --> 00:01:26.201
(chiming)

